<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77955" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-δοχή</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-δοχά</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reception</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.Herc.</u>
				908.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					22.7.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1056f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.55
			</span></i>; of mental <i>apprehension</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>that which has been received, hereditary custom</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάτριοι π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					201
				</span></i>
			; <i>tradition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hippod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.1.95
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινὴ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.146
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Ἑλληνισμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Adv.</u>
					168.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>acceptance, approval</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.5.5
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν βλαβερῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					18p.459M.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>admission, register</i> of persons admitted, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀπὸ τοῦ γυμνασίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					79.24
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Gramm., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν π. τοῦ ἄρθρου γενέσθαι</span>
			<i>admit</i> the use of the article, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				57.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>credit</i> or <i>rebate allowed</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραδέχομαι</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἀβρόχου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					571.11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
